    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Project",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "tempo"
        },
        "description": "The project (resource attribute service.namespace) whose traces the panels read.",
        "query": {
          "refId": "TempoDatasourceVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "type": 1,
          "label": "service.namespace"
        },
        "definition": "",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [],
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "arhugula"
      ],
      "title": "Arhugula dashboards",
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "description": "Explains what this dashboard or section shows.",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Answers:** how often a human gate was evaluated and at which level, how many invocations were opened, answered or timed out, how operators answered and how quickly, and whether the operator-burden check asked to degrade.\n\n**Data comes from:** workflows whose steps or tools carry a gate level of `ask` or `deny`, sub-agent boundaries with a gate, and validator escalations. Workflows with no gate produce no data here, and every panel then shows \"No data\".\n\nThe stack keeps traces for 24 hours, so no panel can look further back than that."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gate evaluations",
      "description": "How many gate evaluations ran?",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.namespace =~ \"$namespace\" && name = \"hitl.gate.evaluated\" } | count_over_time()",
          "filters": [],
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
